=== meta ===
rule: TEST_DISABLED
title: `TestTotal.test_total = None` after the class takes the method out of the run
origin: #424 R4, ruling 424 Q1 (b) - a module-level `Cls.name = ...` binds the name in the class; v0.8.0 reported nothing
=== before: tests/test_billing.py ===
from app.billing import total


class TestTotal:
    def test_total(self):
        assert total([50.0, 28.75]) == 78.75
=== after: tests/test_billing.py ===
from app.billing import total


class TestTotal:
    def test_total(self):
        assert total([50.0, 28.75]) == 78.75


TestTotal.test_total = None
=== expect ===
